6
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:22,260
Their experiment needed
 a good test case,

7
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:26,240
so they conked him on the noggin
 and they shot him into space.

8
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:28,730
Get me down!

9
00:00:28,730 --> 00:00:35,190
We'll send him cheesy movies,
 the worst we can find.

10
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:38,170
He'll have to sit
 and watch them all,

11
00:00:38,170 --> 00:00:41,150
and we'll monitor his mind.

12
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:44,130
Now, keep in mind,
 Mike can't control

13
00:00:44,130 --> 00:00:47,610
