14
00:00:47,610 --> 00:00:52,080
He'll try to keep his sanity
 with the help of his robot

15
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:52,580
friends.

16
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:58,050
Robot roll call-- Cambot.

17
00:00:58,050 --> 00:00:58,550
Show yourself!

18
00:00:58,550 --> 00:00:59,050
Gypsy.

19
00:00:59,050 --> 00:01:00,030
