20
00:01:00,030 --> 00:01:00,530
Tom Servo.

21
00:01:00,530 --> 00:01:02,020
Hello there.

22
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:02,520
Crow.

23
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:03,540
That's one "o."

24
00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:06,170
If you're wondering how
 he eats and breathes

25
00:01:06,170 --> 00:01:10,680
and other science facts,
 just repeat to yourself,

26
00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:12,560
it's just a show.

27
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:36,210
I should really just relax for
 "Mystery Science Theater 3000."

28
00:01:36,210 --> 00:01:37,240
-Sector four clear.

29
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:38,630
Platform secure for traveler.

30
00:01:38,630 --> 00:01:40,020
Proceed.

31
00:01:40,020 --> 00:01:40,690
-Hi, everyone.

32
00:01:40,690 --> 00:01:41,870
Mike Nelson here.

33
00:01:41,870 --> 00:01:44,380
The robots think there's been
 some sort of infiltration

34
