35
00:01:45,660 --> 00:01:47,770
And they think I need
 round-the-clock protection.

36
00:01:47,770 --> 00:01:48,400
Personally, I--

37
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,200
-Go!
 Get down!

38
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:49,760
-Get down!

39
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,440
Get him!

40
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:53,160
